EDC 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성은 임상 운영 전문가, 데이터 관리자, 시술 후원자를 위한 효과적인 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 스킬","es":"Contenido de marketing generado por IA para Talosix EDC, enfocado en operaciones clínicas y gestión de datos","fr":"Contenu marketing généré par IA pour Talosix EDC, axé sur les opérations cliniques et la gestion de données","de":"Von KI generierter Marketinginhalt für Talosix EDC, ausgerichtet auf klinische Operationen und Datenmanagement","pt":"O que é marketing-content? É um skill que gera conteúdo de marketing para a indústria de tecnologia EDC","ru":"Что такое маркетинговый контент? Это ИИ Агент, создающий убедительный контент для клинических операций","ar":"ما هو محتوى التسويق؟ هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء محتوى تسويقي لتقنيات الأبحاث السريرية"},"features":{"en":["Creates content for Clinical Operations Directors concerned with study timelines and budget control","Generates marketing materials for Clinical Data Managers focused on data quality and integrity","Maintains regulatory awareness and evidence-based credibility in all marketing content","Positions Talosix as a leader in clinical trial EDC technology","Resonates with trial sponsors and clinical operations professionals"],"zh":["针对临床运营专业人员、数据经理和试验赞助商的营销内容生成","维持监管意识和基于证据的可信度","创建与临床试验 EDC 技术相关的内容","支持多语言营销内容生成","AIエージェント技术集成"],"ja":["臨床運用専門家、データマネージャー、試験スポンサー向けのマーケティングコンテンツ生成","規制認識とエビデンスベースの信頼性の維持","臨床試験 EDC 技術関連コンテンツの作成","多言語マーケティングコンテンツ生成のサポート","AIエージェント技術の統合"],"ko":["임상 운영 전문가, 데이터 관리자, 시술 후원자를 위한 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성","규제 인식과 증거 기반 신뢰성 유지","임상 시술 EDC 기술 관련 콘텐츠 생성","다언어 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 지원","AI 에이전트 기술 통합"],"es":["Generación de contenido de marketing personalizado para profesionales de operaciones clínicas","Enfoque en la gestión de datos clínicos y el cumplimiento normativo","Posicionamiento de Talosix como líder en tecnología EDC","Contenido basado en evidencia y credibilidad","Orientado a directores de operaciones clínicas y gestores de datos","Conciencia regulatoria y cumplimiento"],"fr":["Génération de contenu marketing personnalisé pour les professionnels des opérations cliniques"," Axe sur la gestion des données cliniques et la conformité réglementaire","Positionnement de Talosix en tant que leader dans la technologie EDC","Contenu basé sur des preuves et une crédibilité","Orienté vers les directeurs des opérations cliniques et les gestionnaires de données","Conscience réglementaire et conformité"],"de":["Generierung von personalisiertem Marketinginhalt für klinische Operations-Professionals","Fokus auf klinisches Datenmanagement und regulatorische Konformität","Positionierung von Talosix als Marktführer in EDC-Technologie","Inhalte basierend auf Beweisen und Glaubwürdigkeit","Ausgerichtet auf klinische Operations- und Datenmanagement-Professionals","Regulatorisches Bewusstsein und Konformität"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo de marketing para diretores de operações clínicas","Criação de conteúdo para gestores de dados clínicos","Destaque da liderança da Talosix em tecnologia EDC","Manutenção da conformidade regulatória","Credibilidade baseada em evidências"],"ru":["Генерация маркетингового контента для директоров клинических операций","Создание контента для менеджеров клинических данных","Подчеркивание лидерства Talosix в технологии EDC","Соответствие нормативным требованиям","Доказательная достоверность"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى تسويقي لمديري العمليات السريرية","تطوير محتوى لمديري البيانات السريرية","تسليط الضوء على ريادة شركة Talosix في تقنيات الأبحاث السريرية","الامتثال للوائح التنظيمية","المنهجية القائمة على الأدلة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use marketing-content for clinical trials","what is marketing-content in EDC technology","marketing-content alternative for clinical operations","marketing-content vs traditional marketing methods","marketing-content setup guide for AI agents","marketing-content install for clinical trial EDC"],"zh":["Talosix EDC 营销内容生成","临床运营专业人员营销","数据管理员营销","试验赞助商营销","AIエージェント营销","营销内容生成工具","临床试验 EDC 技术"],"ja":["Talosix EDC マーケティングコンテンツ生成","臨床運用専門家マーケティング","データマネージャーマーケティング","試験スポンサーマーケティング","AIエージェントマーケティング","マーケティングコンテンツ生成ツール","臨床試験 EDC 技術"],"ko":["Talosix EDC 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성","임상 운영 전문가 마케팅","데이터 관리자 마케팅","시술 후원자 마케팅","AI 에이전트 마케팅","마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 도구","임상 시술 EDC 기술"],"es":["contenido de marketing para Talosix EDC","generación de contenido de marketing","operaciones clínicas","gestión de datos clínicos","tecnología EDC","posicionamiento de marca","contenidos basados en evidencia","conciencia regulatoria","Herramientas de marketing para profesionales de la salud","IA para marketing de salud"],"fr":["contenu marketing pour Talosix EDC","génération de contenu marketing","opérations cliniques","gestion des données cliniques","technologie EDC","positionnement de marque","contenus basés sur des preuves","conscience réglementaire","Outils de marketing pour les professionnels de la santé","IA pour le marketing de la santé"],"de":["Marketinginhalte für Talosix EDC","Generierung von Marketinginhalten","klinische Operationen","klinisches Datenmanagement","EDC-Technologie","Markenpositionierung","Inhalte basierend auf Beweisen","regulatorisches Bewusstsein","Marketingtools für Gesundheitsprofessionals","KI für Gesundheitsmarketing"],"pt":["marketing-content","tecnologia EDC","diretores de operações clínicas","gestores de dados clínicos","conformidade regulatória","credibilidade baseada em evidências"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","маркетинговый контент","технология EDC","директоры клинических операций","менеджеры клинических данных","соответствие нормативным требованиям"],"ar":["أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي","محتوى التسويق","تقنيات الأبحاث السريرية","مديرو العمليات السريرية","مديرو البيانات السريرية","الامتثال للوائح التنظيمية"]}},"owner":"nroze22","repo":"TalosixSkills","repoPath":"nroze22/TalosixSkills","stars":1,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T17:36:46Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marketing-content","description":"Generate marketing content tailored for clinical trial EDC audiences including blog posts, thought leadership articles, and social media content with industry-appropriate tone and SEO optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Marketing Content Generation for Talosix EDC\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate compelling marketing content that positions Talosix as a leader in clinical trial EDC technology. All content must resonate with clinical operations professionals, data managers, and trial sponsors while maintaining regulatory awareness and evidence-based credibility.\n\n## Target Audiences\n\n- **Clinical Operations Directors** — Concerned with study timelines, site performance, budget control\n- **Clinical Data Managers** — Focused","body":"# Marketing Content Generation for Talosix EDC\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate compelling marketing content that positions Talosix as a leader in clinical trial EDC technology. All content must resonate with clinical operations professionals, data managers, and trial sponsors while maintaining regulatory awareness and evidence-based credibility.\n\n## Target Audiences\n\n- **Clinical Operations Directors** — Concerned with study timelines, site performance, budget control\n- **Clinical Data Managers** — Focused on data quality, edit check logic, CDISC compliance, query resolution\n- **CRO Executives** — Evaluating EDC platforms for multi-sponsor use, scalability, speed of deployment\n- **Site Coordinators/CRAs** — Want intuitive interfaces, reduced double-entry, offline capability\n- **IT/Validation Teams** — Need 21 CFR Part 11 compliance, audit trails, integration APIs\n- **Biostatisticians** — Care about data export formats, SDTM mapping, analysis-ready datasets\n\n## Content Types and Guidelines\n\n### Blog Posts\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Hook with a specific clinical trial pain point or industry trend\n2. Contextualize the problem with data or real-world scenario\n3. Present insight or solution approach\n4. Connect to Talosix capability without hard selling\n5. Close with actionable takeaway or CTA\n\n**Tone:** Authoritative but accessible. Avoid jargon overload — explain acronyms on first use. Write at a level that a clinical operations professional with 5+ years experience finds credible.\n\n**Length:** 800-1,200 words for standard posts. 1,500-2,000 for pillar content.\n\n**SEO requirements:**\n- Primary keyword in title, H1, first 100 words, and meta description\n- 2-3 secondary keywords distributed naturally\n- Internal links to related Talosix pages (product, resources, other blog posts)\n- Meta description: 150-160 characters, include primary keyword and value proposition\n\n**Example topics:**\n- \"How Risk-Based Monitoring Changes EDC Requirements\"\n- \"5 Data Quality Metrics Every Clinical Data Manager Should Track\"\n- \"Decentralized Trials: What Your EDC Platform Must Support\"\n- \"CDISC CDASH 3.0: What It Means for Your eCRF Design\"\n\n### Thought Leadership Articles\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Open with a bold, defensible perspective on an industry trend\n2. Support with regulatory references, published data, or market analysis\n3. Explore implications for clinical operations teams\n4. Offer a forward-looking recommendation\n5. Position Talosix philosophy (not product pitch) as aligned with the direction\n\n**Tone:** Executive-level. Cite ICH guidelines, FDA guidance documents, EMA publications where relevant. Reference industry benchmarks (Tufts CSDD, DIA publications, Applied Clinical Trials).\n\n**Length:** 1,200-2,000 words.\n\n**Placement targets:** Applied Clinical Trials, Clinical Leader, ACRP blog, DIA Global Forum, LinkedIn articles.\n\n### Social Media Content\n\n**LinkedIn (primary channel):**\n- Post length: 150-300 words for engagement posts, 50-100 for link shares\n- Lead with a provocative question or surprising statistic\n- Use line breaks for readability\n- Include 3-5 relevant hashtags: #ClinicalTrials #EDC #ClinicalData #eCRF #CDISC #DrugDevelopment\n- Tag relevant organizations (DIA, ACRP, SCDM) when appropriate\n\n**Twitter/X:**\n- 280 character limit per tweet\n- Use threads for complex topics (3-5 tweets)\n- Include one hashtag maximum per tweet for professional tone\n- Link to blog posts or landing pages\n\n**Content pillars for social:**\n1. Industry insights and trend commentary\n2. Product capability highlights (feature-focused, not salesy)\n3. Customer success signals (anonymized metrics, testimonials)\n4. Team and culture (humanize the brand)\n5. Event presence and speaking engagements\n\n## Clinical Trial Industry Tone Guide\n\n### Do:\n- Use evidence-based claims with specific metrics where possible\n- Reference regulatory frameworks (ICH-GCP, 21 CFR Part 11, GDPR, EU CTR)\n- Acknowledge complexity of clinical trial operations\n- Demonstrate understanding of validation requirements\n- Respect the seriousness of patient safety and data integrity\n\n### Do Not:\n- Make unsubstantiated claims about regulatory compliance\n- Use consumer SaaS marketing language (\"disrupt,\" \"revolutionary,\" \"game-changer\")\n- Oversimplify the clinical trial process\n- Promise specific regulatory outcomes\n- Use patient data or identifiable trial information without explicit permission\n\n### Preferred Terminology:\n- \"Electronic Data Capture\" not \"data entry system\"\n- \"eCRF\" not \"electronic form\" (in clinical context)\n- \"Study build\" not \"form creation\"\n- \"Edit checks\" not \"validation rules\" (in EDC context)\n- \"Query management\" not \"error handling\"\n- \"21 CFR Part 11 compliant\" not \"FDA approved\" (for software)\n\n## SEO Keyword Strategy\n\n### Primary Keywords (high intent):\n- clinical trial EDC software\n- electronic data capture system\n- eCRF design software\n- clinical data management system (CDMS)\n- EDC platform for clinical trials\n\n### Secondary Keywords (informational):\n- clinical trial data collection\n- eCRF best practices\n- EDC system validation\n- CDISC compliant EDC\n- risk-based data management\n\n### Long-tail Keywords:\n- \"how to reduce clinical trial data entry errors\"\n- \"EDC system for decentralized clinical trials\"\n- \"CDASH compliant eCRF templates\"\n- \"clinical trial data quality metrics\"\n\n## Content Production Workflow\n\n1. **Brief:** Define topic, target keyword, audience segment, funnel stage\n2. **Outline:** Create structured outline with key points and supporting evidence\n3. **Draft:** Write full draft following tone and structure guidelines\n4. **Review checkpoints:**\n   - Regulatory claim accuracy (no misleading compliance statements)\n   - Brand voice consistency\n   - SEO element completion (meta, headings, links)\n   - CTA alignment with campaign goals\n5. **Approval:** Marketing lead sign-off; legal review if regulatory claims included\n6. **Publish:** Add to CMS with proper metadata, categories, and tracking\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen generating content, provide:\n- Title with primary keyword\n- Meta description (150-160 chars)\n- Full content with H2/H3 structure\n- Suggested internal links\n- Social media promotion snippets (LinkedIn + Twitter)\n- Recommended publication date considerations (avoid major conference weeks unless relevant)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:18:53.030Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing advanced marketing content generation capabilities for clinical trial technology","zh":"非常适合需要高级营销内容生成能力的语言代理，特别是用于临床试验技术","ja":"言語エージェントが臨床試験技術の高度なマーケティングコンテンツ生成機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"임상 시험 기술을 위한 고급 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de contenido de marketing para tecnología de ensayos clínicos","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de contenu marketing pour la technologie d''essais cliniques","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die erweiterte Marketinginhalte-Generierungsfunktionen für klinische Studientechnologie benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de conteúdo de marketing para tecnologia de ensaios clínicos","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации маркетингового контента для технологии клинических испытаний","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتوليد محتوى التسويق للتكنولوجيا التجارب السريرية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create compelling marketing content using evidence-based credibility and regulatory awareness, targeting clinical operations directors, data managers, and trial sponsors, while leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for engaging web content","zh":"赋予代理创建具有证据 기반可信度和法规意识的引人入胜的营销内容的能力，针对临床运营总监、数据管理员和试验赞助商，同时利用 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 创建吸引人的网页内容","ja":"エージェントが証拠に基づく信頼性と規制認識を備えた魅力的なマーケティングコンテンツを作成する能力を与え、臨床運営ディレクター、データマネージャー、試験スポンサーを対象にし、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して魅力的なWebコンテンツを作成する","ko":"에이전트가 증거 기반 신뢰성과 규제 인식을 갖춘 매력적인 마케팅 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 임상 운영 책임자, 데이터 관리자 및 시험이나 후원자를 대상으로 하며, HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 매력적인 웹 콘텐츠를 생성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido de marketing atractivo utilizando credibilidad basada en evidencia y conciencia normativa, dirigido a directores de operaciones clínicas, gestores de datos y patrocinadores de ensayos, aprovechando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para contenido web atractivo","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un contenu marketing convaincant en utilisant une crédibilité basée sur des preuves et une conscience réglementaire, ciblant les directeurs des opérations cliniques, les gestionnaires de données et les sponsors d''essais, tout en exploitant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour un contenu web engageant","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugendes Marketingmaterial zu erstellen, das auf Beweisen basierende Glaubwürdigkeit und regulatorisches Bewusstsein nutzt, gerichtet an klinische Operatorenleiter, Datenmanager und Studiensponsoren, während es HTML, CSS und JavaScript für ansprechende Webinhalte nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de marketing convincente usando credibilidade baseada em evidências e conscientização regulatória, visando diretores de operações clínicas, gerentes de dados e patrocinadores de ensaios, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita HTML, CSS e JavaScript para conteúdo web atraente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать убедительный маркетинговый контент, используя достоверность, основанную на доказательствах, и регулирующую осведомленность, ориентируясь на директоров клинических операций, менеджеров данных и спонсоров испытаний, а также использует HTML, CSS и JavaScript для привлекательного веб-контента","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء محتوى تسويقي مقنع باستخدام مصداقية قائمة على الأدلة والوعي التنظيمي، يستهدف مديري العمليات السريرية ومديري البيانات ومراعاة التجارب، في الوقت نفسه يستفيد من HTML و CSS و JavaScript لإنشاء محتوى ويب جذاب"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts for clinical trial technology thought leadership","Creating email campaigns for clinical operations professionals and trial sponsors","Developing regulatory-compliant landing pages for Talosix EDC services"],"zh":["为临床试验技术思想领导力生成博客文章","为临床运营专业人员和试验赞助商创建电子邮件活动","为 Talosix EDC 服务开发法规遵从性登陆页面"],"ja":["臨床試験技術の思想リーダーシップのためのブログ投稿の生成","臨床運営専門家と試験スポンサーのための電子メールキャンペーンの作成","Talosix EDCサービス向けの規制遵守型ランディングページの開発"],"ko":["임상 시험 기술 사고 지도력의 블로그 게시물 생성","임상 운영 전문가 및 시험 후원자를 위한 이메일 캠페인 생성","Talosix EDC 서비스를 위한 규제 준수 랜딩 페이지 개발"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de blog para el liderazgo en pensamiento de tecnología de ensayos clínicos","Crear campañas de correo electrónico para profesionales de operaciones clínicas y patrocinadores de ensayos","Desarrollar páginas de aterrizaje conformes con las regulaciones para los servicios Talosix EDC"],"fr":["Générer des billets de blog pour le leadership de la pensée dans la technologie d''essais cliniques","Créer des campagnes de courriel pour les professionnels des opérations cliniques et les sponsors d''essais","Développer des pages de destination conformes aux réglementations pour les services Talosix EDC"],"de":["Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen für die Führung im Denken der klinischen Studientechnologie","Erstellen von E-Mail-Kampagnen für klinische Betriebsprofis und Studiensponsoren","Entwicklung regulatorisch konformer Landeseiten für Talosix EDC-Dienstleistungen"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog para liderança de pensamento em tecnologia de ensaios clínicos","Criar campanhas de e-mail para profissionais de operações clínicas e patrocinadores de ensaios","Desenvolver páginas de destino regulamentares para serviços Talosix EDC"],"ru":["Генерировать посты в блоге для лидерства мнений в технологии клинических испытаний","Создавать электронные кампании для специалистов клинических операций и спонсоров испытаний","Разрабатывать регулируемые посадочные страницы для услуг Talosix EDC"],"ar":["توليد منشورات مدونة لقادة الفكر في تكنولوجيا التجارب السريرية","إنشاء حملات البريد الإلكتروني لمهنيي العمليات السريرية ومراعاة التجارب","تطوير صفحات هبوط مطابقة لللوائح لخدمات Talosix EDC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of clinical trial regulations and terminology","Limited to marketing content generation for clinical trial technology","Needs access to brand guidelines and style sheets for consistent branding"],"zh":["需要临床试验法规和术语的知识","仅限于临床试验技术的营销内容生成","需要访问品牌指南和样式表以确保一致的品牌形象"],"ja":["臨床試験規制と用語の知識が必要","臨床試験技術のマーケティングコンテンツ生成に限定","一貫したブランドイメージを確保するためにブランドガイドラインとスタイルシートへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["임상 시험 규정 및 용어의 지식 필요","임상 시험 기술의 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성에 한정","일관된 브랜드 이미지를 보장하기 위해 브랜드 가이드라인 및 스타일 시트에 대한 액세스 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las regulaciones y la terminología de los ensayos clínicos","Limitado a la generación de contenido de marketing para la tecnología de ensayos clínicos","Necesita acceso a directrices de marca y hojas de estilo para una marca consistente"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des réglementations et de la terminologie des essais cliniques","Limité à la génération de contenu marketing pour la technologie d''essais cliniques","Nécessite un accès aux directives de marque et aux feuilles de style pour une marque cohérente"],"de":["Benö