INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('misha-jatt/Personal-AI-Employee-Hackathon-0/gmail-watcher', 'gmail-watcher', 'misha-jatt', 'Personal-AI-Employee-Hackathon-0', 'community', 'gmail-watcher misha-jatt Personal-AI-Employee-Hackathon-0 community The gmail-watcher skill polls the Gmail API for unread important emails, classifying them and creating .md files in /Needs_Action for developers and power users. Gmail Watcher Skill 可以监控 Gmail 中的未读重要邮件，并将其分类为 .md 文件 Gmail Watcher スキルは、Gmail の未読の重要メールを監視し、.md ファイルに分類します Gmail Watcher 스킬은 Gmail의 읽지 않은 중요한 이메일을 모니터링하고 .md 파일로 분류합니다 El agente gmail-watcher utiliza la API de Gmail para detectar correos electrónicos importantes sin leer y crea archivos .md en la carpeta /Needs_Action L''agent gmail-watcher utilise l''API Gmail pour détecter les emails importants non lus et crée des fichiers .md dans le dossier /Needs_Action Der Agent gmail-watcher verwendet die Gmail-API, um wichtige ungelesene E-Mails zu erkennen und erstellt .md-Dateien im Ordner /Needs_Action O Gmail Watcher é uma ferramenta que polla a API do Gmail para e-mails importantes não lidos e cria arquivos .md em /Needs_Action. ИИ Агент Gmail Watcher - это инструмент, который опрашивает Gmail API для важных непрочитанных писем и создает файлы .md в /Needs_Action. جهاز مراقبة الجيميل هو أداة تراقب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الجيميل للبريد الإلكتروني المهم غير المقروء وتạo ملفات .md في /Needs_Action. how to use gmail-watcher gmail-watcher setup guide gmail-watcher alternative gmail api monitoring automated email classification gmail-watcher vs email clients gmail-watcher install what is gmail-watcher gmail-watcher tutorial Gmail Watcher AI 工具 Gmail API 未读重要邮件 监控邮件 分类邮件 重复消息过滤 Polls Gmail API for unread important messages Filters out already-processed message IDs using deduplication Creates .md files in /Needs_Action for classified emails Triggers on commands like ''check gmail'' and ''monitor emails'' Outputs a list of new emails after polling the Gmail API Supports classification of emails based on importance gmail-watcher is a skill that automates Gmail monitoring by polling the Gmail API for unread important messages and organizing them into .md files.');
