INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('pyinx/ceo-skills-plugin/ceo', 'ceo', 'pyinx', 'ceo-skills-plugin', 'community', 'ceo pyinx ceo-skills-plugin community The CEO skill enables full-stack development teams to deliver products from vague requirements to deployment, leveraging 6 professional agents and 11 Superpowers framework skills. It benefits developers seeking streamlined workflow orchestration. CEO Agent是一个全栈开发团队，集成6个专业agents和11个Superpowers框架skills，实现从模糊需求到产品交付的自动化开发流程 CEOエージェントは、6つの専門エージェントと11つのSuperpowersフレームワークスキルを統合したフルスタック開発チームです CEO 에이전트는 6개의 전문 에이전트와 11개의 Superpowers 프레임워크 스킬을 통합한 풀스택 개발 팀입니다 El agente CEO es un equipo de desarrollo de software full-stack que integra 6 agentes profesionales y 11 habilidades de frameworks Superpowers L''agent CEO est une équipe de développement de logiciels full-stack qui intègre 6 agents professionnels et 11 compétences de frameworks Superpowers Der CEO-Agent ist ein Full-Stack-Software-Entwicklungsteam, das 6 professionelle Agenten und 11 Fähigkeiten von Superpowers-Frameworks integriert O CEO Agent é um agente de desenvolvimento de software que integra 6 agentes e 11 habilidades do framework Superpowers para fornecer uma solução completa ИИ Агент CEO - это агент разработки программного обеспечения, который интегрирует 6 агентов и 11 навыков фреймворка Superpowers для предоставления полного решения وكيل الرئيس التنفيذي هو وكيل تطوير برمجي يدمج 6 وكلاء و 11 مهارات إطار العمل Superpowers لتقديم حل كامل how to use CEO for software development CEO alternative for workflow automation CEO vs traditional development methodologies CEO setup guide for AI agents what is CEO in software development CEO install for full-stack development teams CEO Agent 全栈开发 自动化开发流程 需求探索 产品交付 Git worktrees TDD enforcement Parallel agent dispatch Executes a phased workflow including brainstorming, Git worktrees for workspace isolation, and subagent-driven development Utilizes two-stage code review and TDD enforcement for quality assurance Dispatches parallel agents for independent test failures, enhancing fault tolerance Integrates Superpowers frameworks for enhanced workflow capabilities Supports version control with Git worktrees for efficient collaboration CEO is a comprehensive AI agent skill integrating multiple professional agents and Superpowers frameworks for direct orchestration of software development workflows.');
