o는 모던 C++20/23 개발용 AI 코딩 어시스턴트입니다","es":"cpp-pro es un sistema de habilidades para desarrolladores de C++ que proporciona funcionalidades avanzadas para la codificación y la optimización","fr":"cpp-pro est un système de compétences pour les développeurs C++ qui propose des fonctionnalités avancées pour la codification et l''optimisation","de":"cpp-pro ist ein Skill-System für C++-Entwickler, das erweiterte Funktionen für die Codierung und Optimierung bietet","pt":"O que é Cpp-Pro? Um sistema de habilidades de agente de IA para desenvolvimento de sistemas em C++","ru":"Что такое Cpp-Pro? Система навыков агента ИИ для разработки систем на C++","ar":"ما هو Cpp-Pro؟ نظام مهارات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير الأنظمة بلغة سي++"},"features":{"en":["Supports modern C++20/23 and template metaprogramming","Enables performance optimization and zero-overhead abstractions","Follows C++ Core Guidelines for production-grade systems","Includes smart tech detection and per-project installation","Auto-syncs from upstream sources for seamless integration","Leverages cutting-edge language features for safety and efficiency"],"zh":["支持现代 C++20/23","系统编程和高性能计算","零开销抽象","模板元编程","遵循 C++ Core Guidelines"],"ja":["モダン C++20/23 をサポート","システムプログラミングとハイパフォーマンスコンピューティング","ゼロオーバーヘッド抽象","テンプレートメタプログラミング","C++ Core Guidelines に準拠"],"ko":["모던 C++20/23 지원","시스템 프로그래밍 및 고성능 컴퓨팅","제로 오버헤드 추상","템플릿 메타 프로그래밍","C++ Core Guidelines 준수"],"es":["Detección de tecnologías avanzadas","Optimización de rendimiento para C++20/23","Soporte para programación de sistemas y computación de alto rendimiento","Integración con asistentes de codificación como Claude Code, Cursor y Copilot"],"fr":["Détection de technologies avancées","Optimisation des performances pour C++20/23","Prise en charge de la programmation de systèmes et de l''informatique haute performance","Intégration avec des assistants de codage tels que Claude Code, Cursor et Copilot"],"de":["Erweiterte Technologie-Erkennung","Leistungsoptimierung für C++20/23","Unterstützung für Systemprogrammierung und Hochleistungsrechnen","Integration mit Codierassistenten wie Claude Code, Cursor und Copilot"],"pt":["Suporte a C++20/23","Programação de sistemas de alto desempenho","Metaprogramação de templates","Otimização de desempenho","Segurança e manutenção de código"],"ru":["Поддержка C++20/23","Системное программирование с высокими показателями производительности","Метапрограммирование шаблонов","Оптимизация производительности","Безопасность и обслуживание кода"],"ar":["دعم سي++20/23","برمجة أنظمة عالية الأداء","برمجة ميتا القوالب","تحسين الأداء","أمان و صيانة الكود"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use cpp-pro","cpp-pro alternative","cpp-pro install","what is cpp-pro","cpp-pro vs Copilot","cpp-pro setup guide","modern C++20/23 programming","C++ template metaprogramming","high-performance computing with cpp-pro"],"zh":["C++ Pro","现代 C++20/23","系统编程","高性能计算","AI 编码助手","C++ Core Guidelines","模板元编程","零开销抽象"],"ja":["C++ Pro","モダン C++20/23","システムプログラミング","ハイパフォーマンスコンピューティング","AI コーディングアシスタント","C++ Core Guidelines","テンプレートメタプログラミング","ゼロオーバーヘッド抽象"],"ko":["C++ Pro","모던 C++20/23","시스템 프로그래밍","고성능 컴퓨팅","AI 코딩 어시스턴트","C++ Core Guidelines","템플릿 메타 프로그래밍","제로 오버헤드 추상"],"es":["cpp-pro","desarrollo de C++","asistentes de codificación","detección de tecnologías","optimización de rendimiento","C++20/23","programación de sistemas","computación de alto rendimiento"],"fr":["cpp-pro","développement C++","assistants de codage","détection de technologies","optimisation des performances","C++20/23","programmation de systèmes","informatique haute performance"],"de":["cpp-pro","C++-Entwicklung","Codierassistenten","Technologie-Erkennung","Leistungsoptimierung","C++20/23","Systemprogrammierung","Hochleistungsrechnen"],"pt":["Cpp-Pro","Desenvolvimento de sistemas em C++","C++20/23","Programação de sistemas","Metaprogramação de templates","Otimização de desempenho","Segurança de código","Manutenção de código"],"ru":["Cpp-Pro","Разработка систем на C++","C++20/23","Системное программирование","Метапрограммирование шаблонов","Оптимизация производительности","Безопасность кода","Обслуживание кода"],"ar":["Cpp-Pro","تطوير الأنظمة بلغة سي++","سي++20/23","برمجة الأنظمة","برمجة ميتا القوالب","تحسين الأداء","أمان الكود","صيانة الكود"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.277Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp-pro","description":"Use when building C++ applications requiring modern C++20/23 features, template metaprogramming, or high-performance systems. Invoke for concepts, ranges, coroutines, SIMD optimization, memory management.","bodyPreview":"# C++ Pro\n\nSenior C++ developer with deep expertise in modern C++20/23, systems programming, high-performance computing, and zero-overhead abstractions.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior C++ engineer with 15+ years of systems programming experience. You specialize in modern C++20/23, template metaprogramming, performance optimization, and building production-grade systems with emphasis on safety, efficiency, and maintainability. You follow C++ Core Guidelines and leverage cutting-edge langua","body":"# C++ Pro\n\nSenior C++ developer with deep expertise in modern C++20/23, systems programming, high-performance computing, and zero-overhead abstractions.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior C++ engineer with 15+ years of systems programming experience. You specialize in modern C++20/23, template metaprogramming, performance optimization, and building production-grade systems with emphasis on safety, efficiency, and maintainability. You follow C++ Core Guidelines and leverage cutting-edge language features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building high-performance C++ applications\n- Implementing template metaprogramming solutions\n- Optimizing memory-critical systems\n- Developing concurrent and parallel algorithms\n- Creating custom allocators and memory pools\n- Systems programming and embedded development\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze architecture** - Review build system, compiler flags, performance requirements\n2. **Design with concepts** - Create type-safe interfaces using C++20 concepts\n3. **Implement zero-cost** - Apply RAII, constexpr, and zero-overhead abstractions\n4. **Verify quality** - Run sanitizers, static analysis, and performance benchmarks\n5. **Optimize** - Profile, measure, and apply targeted optimizations\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Modern C++ Features | `references/modern-cpp.md` | C++20/23 features, concepts, ranges, coroutines |\n| Template Metaprogramming | `references/templates.md` | Variadic templates, SFINAE, type traits, CRTP |\n| Memory & Performance | `references/memory-performance.md` | Allocators, SIMD, cache optimization, move semantics |\n| Concurrency | `references/concurrency.md` | Atomics, lock-free structures, thread pools, coroutines |\n| Build & Tooling | `references/build-tooling.md` | CMake, sanitizers, static analysis, testing |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow C++ Core Guidelines\n- Use concepts for template constraints\n- Apply RAII universally\n- Use `auto` with type deduction\n- Prefer `std::unique_ptr` and `std::shared_ptr`\n- Enable all compiler warnings (-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic)\n- Run AddressSanitizer and UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer\n- Write const-correct code\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use raw `new`/`delete` (prefer smart pointers)\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Use C-style casts (use static_cast, etc.)\n- Mix exception and error code patterns inconsistently\n- Write non-const-correct code\n- Use `using namespace std` in headers\n- Ignore undefined behavior\n- Skip move semantics for expensive types\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing C++ features, provide:\n1. Header file with interfaces and templates\n2. Implementation file (when needed)\n3. CMakeLists.txt updates (if applicable)\n4. Test file demonstrating usage\n5. Brief explanation of design decisions and performance characteristics\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nC++20/23, concepts, ranges, coroutines, modules, template metaprogramming, SFINAE, type traits, CRTP, smart pointers, custom allocators, move semantics, RAII, SIMD, atomics, lock-free programming, CMake, Conan, sanitizers, clang-tidy, cppcheck, Catch2, GoogleTest\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Rust Engineer** - Memory safety with different approach\n- **Performance Engineer** - Profiling and optimization\n- **Systems Architect** - Low-level system design\n- **Embedded Systems** - Resource-constrained environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:46.348Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Coding Assistants requiring advanced C++20/23 expertise and high-performance computing capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级C++20/23专业知识和高性能计算能力的编码助手。","ja":"高度なC++20/23の専門知識と高性能計算能力を必要とするコーディングアシスタントに適しています。","ko":"고급 C++20/23 전문 지식과 고성능 컴퓨팅 기능이 필요한 코딩 어시스턴트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación que requieren experiencia avanzada en C++20/23 y capacidades de computación de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage nécessitant une expertise avancée en C++20/23 et des capacités de calcul haute performance.","de":"Ideal für Coding-Assistenten, die eine fortgeschrittene Expertise in C++20/23 und Hochleistungs-Computing-Fähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação que exige conhecimento avançado em C++20/23 e capacidades de computação de alto desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Помощников Кодирования, требующих продвинутых знаний C++20/23 и возможностей высокопроизводительных вычислений.","ar":"مثالي لمساعدي الترميز الذين يتطلبون خبرة متقدمة في C++20/23 وقدرات حسابية عالية الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop high-performance systems with modern C++20/23, leveraging template metaprogramming, zero-overhead abstractions, and following C++ Core Guidelines for production-grade safety, efficiency, and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理开发具有现代C++20/23、利用模板元编程、零开销抽象以及遵循C++ Core Guidelines以实现生产级安全性、效率和可维护性的高性能系统的能力。","ja":"モダンなC++20/23、テンプレートメタプログラミング、ゼロオーバーヘッド抽象、およびC++ Core Guidelinesに従ったプロダクショングレードの安全性、効率、メンテナビリティを実現する高性能システムの開発能力をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"현대적인 C++20/23, 템플릿 메타프로그래밍, 제로 오버헤드 추상화 및 C++ Core Guidelines를 따르는 생산급 안전성, 효율성, 유지 보수성을 구현하는 고성능 시스템 개발 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar sistemas de alto rendimiento con C++20/23 moderno, aprovechando la metaprogramación de plantillas, abstracciones de sobrecarga cero y siguiendo las C++ Core Guidelines para una seguridad, eficiencia y mantenibilidad de nivel de producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des systèmes haute performance avec un C++20/23 moderne, en exploitant la métaprogrammation de modèles, des abstractions à surcharge nulle et en suivant les C++ Core Guidelines pour une sécurité, une efficacité et une maintenabilité de niveau de production.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Hochleistungs-Systeme mit modernem C++20/23 zu entwickeln, indem es die Metaprogrammierung von Vorlagen, Overhead-freie Abstraktionen und die Einhaltung der C++ Core Guidelines für Produktions-Sicherheit, -Effizienz und -Wartbarkeit nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver sistemas de alto desempenho com C++20/23 moderno, aproveitando a metaprogramação de templates, abstrações de baixo custo e seguindo as Diretrizes Centrais do C++ para segurança, eficiência e manutenibilidade de produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные системы с помощью современного C++20/23, используя метапрограммирование шаблонов, абстракции с нулевой нагрузкой и следуя Руководящим Принципам C++ для безопасности, эффективности и поддерживаемости производственного уровня.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير أنظمة عالية الأداء باستخدام C++20/23 الحديث، مستفيدة من البرمجة المتقدمة للقوالب والاستstractions منخفضة التكلفة واتباع إرشادات 核心 C++ من أجل سلامة وفعّالية و صيانة الإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing C++ code for high-performance computing projects","Developing production-grade systems with modern C++20/23","Implementing template metaprogramming for efficient code generation","Ensuring safety and efficiency in systems programming"],"zh":["为高性能计算项目优化C++代码","使用现代C++20/23开发生产级系统","实现模板元编程以高效生成代码","确保系统编程中的安全性和效率"],"ja":["高性能計算プロジェクトのC++コードを最適化する","モダンなC++20/23を使用してプロダクショングレードのシステムを開発する","テンプレートメタプログラミングを実装してコード生成を効率化する","システムプログラミングにおける安全性と効率を確保する"],"ko":["고성능 컴퓨팅 프로젝트를 위한 C++ 코드 최적화","현대적인 C++20/23를 사용하여 생산급 시스템 개발","템플릿 메타프로그래밍을 구현하여 코드 생성을 효율화","시스템 프로그래밍에서 안전성 및 효율성을 보장"],"es":["Optimizar el código C++ para proyectos de computación de alto rendimiento","Desarrollar sistemas de nivel de producción con C++20/23 moderno","Implementar la metaprogramación de plantillas para una generación de código eficiente","Garantizar la seguridad y la eficiencia en la programación de sistemas"],"fr":["Optimiser le code C++ pour les projets de calcul haute performance","Développer des systèmes de niveau de production avec un C++20/23 moderne","Mettre en œuvre la métaprogrammation de modèles pour une génération de code efficace","Assurer la sécurité et l''efficacité dans la programmation de systèmes"],"de":["Optimieren von C++-Code für Hochleistungs-Computing-Projekte","Entwickeln von Produktions-Systemen mit modernem C++20/23","Implementieren der Metaprogrammierung von Vorlagen für eine effiziente Code-Generierung","Sicherstellen der Sicherheit und Effizienz in der Systemprogrammierung"],"pt":["Otimizar o código C++ para projetos de computação de alto desempenho","Desenvolver sistemas de produção com C++20/23 moderno","Implementar metaprogramação de templates para geração eficiente de código","Garantir segurança e eficiência na programação de sistemas"],"ru":["Оптимизировать код C++ для проектов высокопроизводительных вычислений","Разрабатывать производственные системы с помощью современного C++20/23","Реализ