:"GitHub Issue Creator는 MCP 모니터링 및 eBPF용 구조화된 GitHub 문제를 자동 생성하는 스킬입니다","es":"github-issue-creator es un skill que automatiza la creación de problemas de GitHub estructurados para proyectos como MCPSpy","fr":"github-issue-creator est un skill qui automatise la création de problèmes GitHub structurés pour des projets tels que MCPSpy","de":"github-issue-creator ist ein Skill, der die Erstellung strukturierter GitHub-Probleme für Projekte wie MCPSpy automatisiert","pt":"O github-issue-creator é uma ferramenta de automação para criar problemas no GitHub com nomeação padrão e corpo personalizado.","ru":"ИИ Агент github-issue-creator - это инструмент для автоматизации создания проблем на GitHub с стандартным именованием и настраиваемым содержанием.","ar":"وظيفة github-issue-creator هي أداة ت 자동 إنشاء مشاكل على GitHub مع تسمية قياسية وجسم مخصص."},"features":{"en":["Utilizes the gh issue CLI tool for creating GitHub issues","Supports creation of issues with long bodies using temporary markdown files","Follows standard prefixes for issue naming, such as feat(component) and fix(component)","Compatible with MCPSpy project components, including library-manager, ebpf, and http","Allows for efficient issue creation using the gh issue create --body-file option"],"zh":["使用 gh issue CLI 工具创建 GitHub 问题","支持临时 markdown 文件创建长问题体","使用标准前缀：feat(component) 、chore 、fix(component)","支持组件命名约定：library-manager 、ebpf 、mcp 、http 、output"],"ja":["gh issue CLI ツールを使用して GitHub の問題を作成する","長い問題本文のための臨時 markdown ファイルのサポート","標準のプレフィックス：feat(component) 、chore 、fix(component)","コンポーネント命名規約のサポート：library-manager 、ebpf 、mcp 、http 、output"],"ko":["gh issue CLI 도구를 사용하여 GitHub 문제를 생성합니다","긴 문제 본문의 임시 markdown 파일 지원","표준 접두사：feat(component) 、chore 、fix(component)","컴포넌트 명명 규칙 지원：library-manager 、ebpf 、mcp 、http 、output"],"es":["Soporte para la herramienta gh issue CLI","Creación de problemas de GitHub estructurados","Uso de prefijos estándar para nombrar problemas","Compatibilidad con proyectos como MCPSpy","Integración con MCP Monitoring y eBPF"],"fr":["Prise en charge de l''outil gh issue CLI","Création de problèmes GitHub structurés","Utilisation de préfixes standard pour nommer les problèmes","Compatibilité avec des projets tels que MCPSpy","Intégration avec le monitoring MCP et eBPF"],"de":["Unterstützung für das Tool gh issue CLI","Erstellung strukturierter GitHub-Probleme","Verwendung standardisierter Präfixe für die Benennung von Problemen","Kompatibilität mit Projekten wie MCPSpy","Integration mit MCP Monitoring und eBPF"],"pt":["Criação automática de problemas no GitHub","Utilização do CLI tool gh issue","Nomeação padrão com prefixos standard","Corpo personalizado para problemas","Suporte à criação de problemas com corpo longo"],"ru":["Автоматизированное создание проблем на GitHub","Использование CLI инструмента gh issue","Стандартное именование с префиксами","Настройка содержания для проблем","Поддержка создания проблем с большим содержанием"],"ar":["إنشاء تلقائي لمشاكل على GitHub","استخدام أداة CLI gh issue","تسمية قياسية مع بادئات стандарт","جسم مخصص لمشاكل","دعم إنشاء مشاكل مع جسم طويل"]},"keywords":{"en":["github-issue-creator setup guide","how to use github-issue-creator","github-issue-creator vs manual issue creation","github-issue-creator install","github-issue-creator for MCPSpy project","automated github issue creation","gh issue CLI tool tutorial","github issue naming convention best practices"],"zh":["GitHub Issue Creator","MCP 监控","eBPF","AI 工具","自动创建 GitHub 问题","结构化 GitHub 问题","gh issue CLI","临时 markdown 文件"],"ja":["GitHub Issue Creator","MCP モニタリング","eBPF","AI エージェント","自動で GitHub の問題を作成","構造化された GitHub の問題","gh issue CLI","臨時 markdown ファイル"],"ko":["GitHub Issue Creator","MCP 모니터링","eBPF","AI 도구","자동 생성 GitHub 문제","구조화된 GitHub 문제","gh issue CLI","임시 markdown 파일"],"es":["github-issue-creator","MCP Monitoring","eBPF","gh issue CLI","problemas de GitHub estructurados","automatización de problemas","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agentes para desarrollo","github issue creator español"],"fr":["github-issue-creator","Monitoring MCP","eBPF","gh issue CLI","problèmes GitHub structurés","automatisation de problèmes","outils de développement","Agents IA pour le développement","github issue creator français"],"de":["github-issue-creator","MCP Monitoring","eBPF","gh issue CLI","strukturierte GitHub-Probleme","Automatisierung von Problemen","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agenten für Entwicklung","github issue creator deutsch"],"pt":["github-issue-creator","MCP Monitoring","eBPF","CLI tool gh issue","automação de problemas","nomeação padrão","corpo personalizado","criação de problemas"],"ru":["ИИ Агент github-issue-creator","Мониторинг MCP","eBPF","CLI инструмент gh issue","автоматизация проблем","стандартное именование","настраиваемое содержание","создание проблем"],"ar":["وظيفة github-issue-creator","مراقبة MCP","eBPF","أداة CLI gh issue","تأليف تلقائي لمشاكل","تسمية قياسية","جسم مخصص","إنشاء مشاكل"]}},"owner":"alex-ilgayev","repo":"MCPSpy","repoPath":"alex-ilgayev/MCPSpy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.295Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-issue-creator","description":"Creates well-structured GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project using the gh CLI tool. Use when asked to create issues, report bugs, or document features. Follows conventional naming with feat/chore/fix prefixes and maintains appropriate detail levels.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Issue Creator Skill\n\nAutomates the creation of well-structured GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project.\n\n## Tools and Usage\n\nUse the `gh issue` CLI tool to create GitHub issues. If the issue body is rather long, write it to a temporary markdown file and use the `gh issue create --body-file <file>` option.\n\n## Issue Naming Convention\n\n- Use standard prefixes: `feat(component):`, `chore:`, `fix(component):`\n- Component examples: `library-manager`, `ebpf`, `mcp`, `http`, `output`\n- Brackets a","body":"# GitHub Issue Creator Skill\n\nAutomates the creation of well-structured GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project.\n\n## Tools and Usage\n\nUse the `gh issue` CLI tool to create GitHub issues. If the issue body is rather long, write it to a temporary markdown file and use the `gh issue create --body-file <file>` option.\n\n## Issue Naming Convention\n\n- Use standard prefixes: `feat(component):`, `chore:`, `fix(component):`\n- Component examples: `library-manager`, `ebpf`, `mcp`, `http`, `output`\n- Brackets are optional but recommended for clarity\n- Keep titles concise and descriptive\n\n### Examples\n\n- `feat(library-manager): add support for container runtime detection`\n- `chore: update dependencies to latest versions`\n- `fix(ebpf): handle kernel version compatibility issues`\n\n## Issue Content Guidelines\n\n### What to Include\n\n- **High-level design notes** - focus on the \"what\" and \"why\"\n- **POC-level details** - enough to get started, not exhaustive\n- **Actionable scope** - should be implementable by a developer familiar with the codebase\n\n### What NOT to Include\n\n- Detailed test plans\n- Exhaustive acceptance criteria\n- Deep technical specifications\n- Code examples (unless absolutely necessary for clarity)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new feature requests\n- Reporting bugs and issues\n- Documenting technical debt\n- Planning work items for the MCPSpy project\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:11.775Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated GitHub issue creation and management.","zh":"适合需要自动化 GitHub 问题创建和管理的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub の問題の自動作成と管理が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 이슈 자동 생성 및 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan creación y gestión automatizada de problemas de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de création et de gestion automatisées de problèmes GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Erstellung und Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de criação e gerenciamento automatizados de problemas do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное создание и управление проблемами GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وإدارة مشاكل GitHub آليًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create well-structured GitHub issues using the gh issue CLI tool, supporting standard prefixes and component naming conventions, and efficiently handling long issue bodies with temporary markdown files.","zh":"赋予代理创建结构良好的 GitHub 问题的能力，使用 gh issue CLI 工具，支持标准前缀和组件命名约定，并使用临时 markdown 文件高效处理长问题主体。","ja":"エージェントが標準の接頭辞とコンポーネント命名規約をサポートして、gh issue CLI ツールを使用して構造化された GitHub の問題を作成する機能を提供し、長い問題本文を一時的な Markdown ファイルで効率的に処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 gh issue CLI 도구를 사용하여 표준 접두사와 컴포�ント命명 규칙을 지원하는 구조화된 GitHub 이슈를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 임시 Markdown 파일을 통해 긴 이슈 본문을 효율적으로 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear problemas de GitHub bien estructurados utilizando la herramienta CLI de gh issue, que admite prefijos estándar y convenciones de denominación de componentes, y maneja de manera eficiente los cuerpos de problemas largos con archivos markdown temporales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub bien structurés en utilisant l''outil CLI de gh issue, qui prend en charge les préfixes standard et les conventions de dénomination de composants, et gère de manière efficace les corps de problèmes longs avec des fichiers markdown temporaires.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, gut strukturierte GitHub-Probleme mit dem gh Issue-CLI-Tool zu erstellen, das Standardpräfixe und Komponentenbenennungskonventionen unterstützt und lange Probleminhalte mit temporären Markdown-Dateien effizient handhabt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem problemas do GitHub bem estruturados usando a ferramenta CLI gh issue, que suporta prefixos padrão e convenções de nomenclatura de componentes, e lida de forma eficiente com corpos de problemas longos com arquivos markdown temporários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать хорошо структурированные проблемы GitHub с помощью инструмента CLI gh issue, поддерживающего стандартные префиксы и соглашения об именовании компонентов, и эффективно обрабатывает длинные тексты проблем с помощью временных файлов markdown.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء مشاكل GitHub منظمة جيدًا باستخدام أداة CLI gh issue، مع دعم لمعرفات قياسية وتوافق أسماء المكونات، ويتعامل بفعالية مع جسم المشكلة الطويلة باستخدام ملفات markdown مؤقتة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue creation for the MCPSpy project","Generating issues with standardized naming conventions","Streamlining issue management with CLI tool integration"],"zh":["MCPSpy 프로젝트에 대한 이슈 자동 생성","표준화된 이름 규칙을 사용하여 이슈 생성","CLI 툴 통합을 통한 이슈 관리 최적화"],"ja":["MCPSpy プロジェクトの問題自動作成","標準化された名前付け規則を使用した問題作成","CLI ツール統合による問題管理の最適化"],"ko":["MCPSpy 프로젝트에 대한 이슈 자동 생성","표준화된 이름 규칙을 사용하여 이슈 생성","CLI 툴 통합을 통한 이슈 관리 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas para el proyecto MCPSpy","Generación de problemas con convenciones de denominación estandarizadas","Optimización de la gestión de problemas con la integración de la herramienta CLI"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes pour le projet MCPSpy","Génération de problèmes avec des conventions de dénomination standardisées","Optimisation de la gestion des problèmes avec l''intégration de l''outil CLI"],"de":["Automatisierung der Problemerstellung für das MCPSpy-Projekt","Erstellung von Problemen mit standardisierten Benennungskonventionen","Optimierung der Problemmgmt mit der Integration des CLI-Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas para o projeto MCPSpy","Gerar problemas com convenções de nomenclatura padronizadas","Otimizar o gerenciamento de problemas com integração da ferramenta CLI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем для проекта MCPSpy","Генерировать проблемы со стандартизированными соглашениями об именовании","Оптимизировать управление проблемами с помощью интеграции инструмента CLI"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء المشاكل لمشروع MCPSpy","إنشاء مشاكل bằng توافق أسماء معايير","تحسين إدارة المشاكل من خلال دمج أداة CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh issue CLI tool installation","Limited to GitHub issues only"],"zh":["需要安装 gh issue CLI 工具","仅限 GitHub 问题"],"ja":["gh issue CLI ツールのインストールが必要","GitHub の問題のみ"],"ko":["gh 이슈 CLI 도구 설치 필요","GitHub 이슈만 지원"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta CLI de gh issue","Limitado solo a problemas de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil CLI de gh issue","Limité uniquement aux problèmes GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des gh Issue-CLI-Tools","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Probleme nur"],"pt":["Requer instalação da ferramenta CLI gh issue","Limitado apenas a problemas do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента CLI gh issue","Ограничен только проблемами GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة CLI gh issue","محدود بمشاكل GitHub فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"3719971b7e2f0da37d3fecb022fcffcb6994a0fbb907183ada0ce57724a286b8","qualityScore":47}');
