and and decision schemas from contracts/schemas/ Validates each JSON fixture against the correct schema Treats invalid_*.json fixtures as expected failures Emits a summary and exits with status 1 if expectations are not met Prints validation reports to stdout contract-checker is a skill that validates JSON fixtures against predefined schemas, ensuring data integrity and consistency.');
